{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、目の前にいた花奈がふと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！中3組が並んでる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ったので、その横にいた\n真夏に写真撮ってもらいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/26/2062700/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくちゃんが決め決めポーズしだしたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"直ぐに真似する私と、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え、これやんなきゃいけないやつ？？\nと少し怪訝そうなめーちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/26/2062700/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相変わらず決め決めないくちゃんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんないくちゃんを見つめる私とめーちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/26/2062700/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何かに笑う私といくちゃんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人決め決めなめーちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相変わらずな私たちです(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、めーちゃんの紙に\nいくちゃんがサインを落書きしてたから\n私とめーちゃんもサイン書いてみたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなハートがお揃いだった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/26/2062700/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくちゃんは最近サインを変えたんだって○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このサイン書かれた紙どうするの〜？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思うでしょーー(｡･o･｡)ﾉ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブが終わったらポイするって\nめーちゃんが言ってました( ˙³˙)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふ∠( ˙-˙ )／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「メランコリーキッチン」米津玄師さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞くと歌いたくなる。\n鼻歌を歌いたくなる。\nテンポも良いし、歌詞もいい。\n歌詞の裏に隠された意味を\n考えるのもまた楽しい。\nチェリーボンボンと\nタルトタタンの部分がなんか好き。\nあと、Bメロが好き！！\n誰もいないキッチン〜の部分。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のブログの、\n絵のキャラクターの正解は。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「クレヨンしんちゃんのしんのすけ」でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構顔の形からしんのすけを\n当ててくれた方もいたんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しんのすけの妹のひまわり！とか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少年アシベ！とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々な意見があってちょっと面白かった( ◦˙ ˙◦ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんクイズ答えてくれてありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかった :-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の絵は中の中の上だけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絵を気に入ってくれた方や\n他の絵も見たい〜って方もいたので\n(嬉しい。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また少し落書きしたら載せるね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/26/2062700/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐで神宮だ〜！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}